关于第三方内容的说明 / Third-party notice

本仓库只包含「译文词库」与「改写工具」，**不包含也不分发** Anthropic 的
Claude Code 扩展代码或任何二进制产物。

This repository contains only translation dictionaries and a rewriting tool.
It does **not** contain or redistribute the Claude Code extension, its bundle,
or any Anthropic binaries. The English source used as a baseline is snapshotted
locally on the user's own machine from their own installation, and never
committed to this repository.

"Claude" and "Claude Code" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC. This project is an
unofficial community localization and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Anthropic.
